This repository contains Playbooks under multiple different licenses. Playbooks inherit the license of the detection they are based on.

Sigma
-----

Playbooks based on SigmaHQ rules (sigma/playbooks/individual/sigmahq/) are covered under the Detection Rule License (DRL) 1.1:
https://github.com/SigmaHQ/Detection-Rule-License

Playbooks based on detections authored by Security Onion Solutions (sigma/playbooks/individual/sos/), along with the category and engine baseline playbooks, are Copyright (c) Security Onion Solutions, LLC and are covered under the license of the corresponding detection in its source repository.

NIDS
----

Playbooks based on ETOPEN rules with sids 1 through 3464, and 100000000 through 100000908 are under the GPLv2.
A copy of that license is available at http://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-2.0.html

Playbooks based on ETOPEN rules with sids 2000000 through 2799999 are from Emerging Threats and are covered under the BSD License
as follows:

